00:37:27,640 --> 00:37:35,800
 So these are some common heuristics that people often use.

401
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:46,080
 So one of the very popular heuristics that people use is the furthest centers heuristics.

402
00:37:46,080 --> 00:37:56,120
 So in this case intuitively we attempt to make sure that the centers that we are choosing

403
00:37:56,120 --> 00:38:01,440
 initially are far apart.

404
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:06,160
 So they are like very dispersed from one another that is the basic intuition behind this particular

405
00:38:06,160 --> 00:38:08,160
 approach.

