00:39:19,680 --> 00:39:26,800
 good solution to tackle the initial cluster centroid selection problem but you know in

421
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:34,120
 a real life data you do not expect the data to be good and therefore it has its own problems

422
00:39:34,120 --> 00:39:39,360
 which you will see in the next slide.

423
00:39:39,360 --> 00:39:47,840
 So let us look at this particular data okay so clearly from this particular data what we

