00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:57,840
 see is that the data has at least 3 outliers in the sense that somehow it is noisy data

425
00:39:57,840 --> 00:40:03,280
 they are very far apart from the other data points and so on so forth.

426
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:11,480
 So now say we have decided to apply the furthest center heuristic to figure out say 4 cluster

